    ji "一开始我震惊又困惑。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:182
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_5546371d:

    # ji "Then I felt betrayed because you've been sleeping with the guy you encouraged me to date."
    ji "然后我觉得自己遭到了背叛，因为你一直在和那个你鼓励我约会的男人上床。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:184
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_ab192aa5:

    # ji "Then I felt betrayed because you've been sleeping with the guy I dated, who you said wasn't good enough for me to date."
    ji "然后我感到被背叛，因为你一直在和我约会的那个男生睡觉，而你之前还说他配不上我。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:186
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_b8214ab5:

    # ji "And then I felt weirded out. I mean, you're his teacher, and there's a pretty big age gap."
    ji "然后我感觉有点怪怪的。我是说，你是他的老师，而且年龄差还挺大的。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:188
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_267beb51:

    # ji "And now I'm back to feeling...annoyed with both of you."
    ji "现在我又开始烦你们两个了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:189
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_eae67f9f:

    # ji "And I can't wrap my head around it... Why didn't you tell me?"
    ji "我就是想不通……你为什么不说？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:191
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_df4de95c_1:

    # isa "I'm so sorry... I should have told you sooner, but I've been trying to fight my feelings."
    isa "真的很对不起……我早该告诉你，可我一直在试图压抑自己的感情。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:192
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_50e8974c_1:

    # isa "And it got to the point where I couldn't fight them anymore."
    isa "而且我终于撑不住了，控制不住自己的感觉了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:194
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_5f5c63c0:

    # ji "Your feelings?"
    ji "你的感情？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:195
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_b86bba80:

    # ji "How long has this been going on?"
    ji "这事儿持续多久了？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:197
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_e8f73bc2_1:

    # isa "I...I don't know. I mean, what you saw was the first time - well, the night before that was the first time."
    isa "我……我不知道。你看见的那次是第一次——不，前一晚才是第一次。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:198
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_ce8051a8:

    # isa "And I'd felt some attraction earlier, but-"
    isa "而且更早之前，我就对他有些心动，可是——"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:200
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_e61fac79_1:

    # ji "So, you've known this for how long exactly?"
    ji "那么，你到底知道多久了？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:202
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_0df06c5d_1:

    # isa "I've been fighting this since before you even dated him."
    isa "我从你开始和他约会之前就一直在和这种感觉作斗争。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:203
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_81c2de3b_1:

    # isa "I didn't plan for this to happen."
    isa "我没打算让它变成这样。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:205
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_4cbf7a32_1:

    # isa "Jill... I'm so sorry."
    isa "Jill……真的很对不起。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:206
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_194fe928_1:

    # isa "If you're not ok with this, I'll stop. I'll stop it right now."
    isa "如果你不能接受，我会停下。现在就结束这一切。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:207
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_394631f2_1:

    # isa "I'd never give you up for him."
    isa "我绝不会为了他而放弃你。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:209
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_1ffe9ae9:

    # ji "This is not about whether you should stop or not."
    ji "这不关乎你该不该停下。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:210
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_c146ab94:

    # ji "You didn't trust me enough to tell me this in the first place, and you knew I was dating him."
    ji "你一开始就不够信任我，连这件事都不肯告诉我，而且你明明知道我在和他约会。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:211
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_61ba65e3:

    # ji "You could have told me so much earlier, and you didn't... Don't you understand how that makes me feel?"
    ji "你完全可以更早告诉我，可你没这么做……你明白这让我感觉怎么样吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:213
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_fb623a7e_3:

    # isa "..."
    isa "……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:215
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_59355bf9_1:

    # isa "You're right. There's no excuse for it."
    isa "你说得对，这确实没借口。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:217
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_3342f3e9:

    # ji "You're always lecturing me about how to behave and think."
    ji "你总是教训我该怎么做、怎么想。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:218
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_c11658b5:

    # ji "Telling me I'm naive and that I should grow up and become a better person by your standards."
    ji "说我天真，说我该长大，按照你的标准成为更好的人。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:220
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_3f9c804a_1:

    # isa "I don't tell you that."
    isa "我没跟你说过。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:222
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_67e3e767_1:

    # ji "It's implied in the way you say it. It makes me feel like I'm not good enough at times."
    ji "你说话时的语气就是这个意思，有时候会让我觉得自己不够好。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:223
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_2fcc19e1_1:

    # ji "And as it turns out..."
    ji "可结果呢……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:224
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_afe889d4_1:

    # ji "You're the one who's been doing wrong."
    ji "你是那个一直在做错事的人。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:226
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_a8456c4f:

    # isa "After all this time together and seeing what I've been through, I thought you'd understand me better."
    isa "经历了这么久的相处，看到我经历的一切，我以为你会更了解我。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:228
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_2074f717_1:

    # ji "You know what? I would have."
    ji "你知道吗？我本来会的。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:229
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_ab45eb3b:

    # ji "But you didn't tell me about it. And I tell you about everything."
    ji "但你没告诉我这些。而我却把一切都告诉你了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:232
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_be7236cd:

    # ji "What scares me the most is that I was close to falling for him..."
    ji "最让我害怕的是，我几乎要爱上他了……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:233
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_6397573e:

    # ji "What would that have been like? When you never told me that you wanted him?"
    ji "那会是什么感觉？你从没告诉我你一直想要他。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:235
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_19fbb8c6:

    # ji "What would you have done if I had fallen for him when you knew that you wanted him all this time?"
    ji "你明明一直都想要他。要是我当时已经爱上了他，你会怎么做？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:237
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_fb623a7e_4:

    # isa "..."
    isa "……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:239
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_3ee55f22:

    # ji "I need to be alone for a while."
    ji "我需要一个人待一会儿。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:241
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_ede9357b:

    # isa "I'm so sorry."
    isa "真的很对不起。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:249
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_df25fec3:

    # mc "What the hell? Are you alright?"
    mc "什么鬼？你没事吧？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:251
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_f28b3ab9:

    # mc "Are you alright?"
    mc "你没事吧？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:253
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_015d2ece:

    # isa "No."
    isa "不。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:257
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_a6ccbd77:

    # mc "Have you talked since?"
    mc "你们有谈过吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:258
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_170843da:

    # isa "I've been writing to her to say I'm sorry, but she hasn't replied."
    isa "我给她写了信道歉，但她一直没回。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:260
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_3e7e69ea:

    # mc "This explains why she's been avoiding me too..."
    mc "这就解释了她为什么也在躲着我……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:261
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_afda8f7d:

    # mc "I should try to talk to her."
    mc "我应该试着跟她谈谈。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:262
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_672179c3:

    # mc "What you said to her... That you'd end this for her... Is that what you want?"
    mc "你对她说了什么……说要为她结束这一切……你真的想这么做吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:264
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_ba3c066d:

    # isa "I wouldn't have a choice. Without Jill, I..."
    isa "我别无选择。没有Jill，我……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:265
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_23cb3e7c:

    # isa "Jill means the world to me."
    isa "Jill就是我的整个世界。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:267
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_a6119236:

    # mc "This is all my fault."
    mc "这都是我的错。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:270
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_e1051e4f:

    # isa "It's not. It's my fault too."
    isa "不是。我也该负责。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:272
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_0356f797:

    # isa "It's not. It's my fault."
    isa "不是。也是我的错。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:274
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_dfae1ab8:

    # mc "I shouldn't have dated her at the same time. Then none of this would have happened."
    mc "我不应该和她同时约会。那样的话，这一切都不会发生。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:277
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_83c20453:

    # isa "You don't know that. Maybe she'd have gotten feelings for you even so."
    isa "你不能确定。就算你没同时和她约会，她或许还是会对你产生感情。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:278
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_5b1fdb4e:

    # isa "Even though it felt wrong, I should have told her about my feelings for you earlier."
    isa "虽然当时觉得不对劲，但我应该早点告诉她我对你的感觉。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:280
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_312d9cd8:

    # isa "No, it's because I was scared. I didn't dare to voice my feelings for you to her earlier."
    isa "不，是因为我害怕。我之前不敢把对你的感情告诉她。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:282
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_1e1966d0:

    # mc "You've got feelings for me?"
    mc "你对我也有感觉？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:284
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_6238009a:

    # isa "Of course, I have."
    isa "当然有。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:289
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_2d45b352:

    # mc "I have feelings for you too."
    mc "我也对你有感觉。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:291
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_d9bda0f9:

    # mc "Wow... That's nice."
    mc "哇……这感觉真不错。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:298
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_45e7ec77:

    # mc "(...)"
    mc "（……）"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:302
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_ad98f017:

    # mc "Bella..."
    mc "贝拉……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:304
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_685f41ac:

    # isa "Hi. Is it safe?"
    isa "嗨。现在安全吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:306
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_41c46002:

    # mc "Yeah, the door's locked. Come on in."
    mc "对，门锁着。进来吧。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:310
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_90545c3e:

    # mc "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    mc "*{i}亲吻声{/i}*"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:312
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_8dd19a93:

    # isa "You seem relaxed."
    isa "你看起来挺放松的。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:314
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_fd8c2716:

    # mc "Believe me; I'm not. This party has been hectic up until now."
    mc "相信我，我可不是。这派对到目前为止可真是够折腾的。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:315
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_f0fab3a8:

    # mc "But seeing you calms me down."
    mc "可一看到你，我就平静下来了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:318
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_58b44e73:

    # mc "I'm so happy you came."
    mc "我真高兴你来了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:320
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_04ad5269:

    # isa "I went back and forth but eventually decided to come."
    isa "我犹豫了很久，最后还是决定过来。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:323
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_1b85d239:

    # isa "So, your costume... It doesn't leave much to the imagination."
    isa "所以你的装扮……简直毫无遮掩。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:325
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_9ff6d12c:

    # mc "If Spartans wore shirts, I would have."
    mc "如果斯巴达人穿衬衫，我也会。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:328
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_b2865770:

    # isa "It must be nice to wear a helmet without a penis on it."
    isa "头盔上没有画着一根鸡巴，戴起来一定很舒服吧。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:330
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_6f233cb5:

    # mc "Haha! Very."
    mc "哈哈！挺不错的。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:332
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_7013fa97:

    # isa "You look good."
    isa "你看起来不错。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:334
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_16606eae:

    # isa "I hope this costume idea works out. If it doesn't, I will leave."
    isa "希望这个装扮能行得通。如果不行，我就走了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:336
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_eb1c7721:

    # mc "It will work out. Did you bring makeup?"
    mc "肯定没问题。你带化妆品了吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:338
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_1d25ad64:

    # isa "I did. Where's the costume?"
    isa "带了。化装服在哪儿？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:340
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_9b66402f:

    # mc "I'll get it. I hope the size is right."
    mc "我去拿。希望尺码合适。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:342
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_b44376c6:

    # isa "So, how do we get into the bathroom?"
    isa "那我们怎么进去浴室？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:344
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_4396e5c8:

    # mc "I'll make sure the coast is clear."
    mc "我会确保没人看到。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:347
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_17008257:

    # mc "Do you need any help?"
    mc "你还需要帮忙吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:348
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_94e2a295:

    # isa "Not with this."
    isa "这个不用你帮。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:350
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_7dcad13b:

    # mc "How hard can it be? It's scary makeup. Any makeup I would apply would look scary."
    mc "能有多难？不就是恐怖妆吗？我随手一画，肯定就够吓人了。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:352
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_afb33caa:

    # isa "I don't doubt that."
    isa "这点我毫不怀疑。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:354
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_ae0ef9c1:

    # mc "Will you be ok at the party? I mean, you don't know the people here."
    mc "你会在派对上应付得来吗？我是说，你还不太认识在场的人。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:356
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_966c8bf1:

    # isa "I think I recognize more people than you think."
    isa "我觉得我认识的人比你想象的要多。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:358
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_882eea18:

    # mc "It's pretty cool. If you think about it, you have double costumes. You're a college student dressed as a mummy."
    mc "仔细想想还挺酷的，你有两层伪装：大学老师扮成大学生，大学生又扮成木乃伊。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:360
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_cd88156c:

    # isa "Don't worry. While I'd appreciate your company tonight, don't feel like you have to babysit me when you have things to deal with."
    isa "别担心。虽然我很高兴今晚能和你一起，但如果你有事要处理，也不用一直照顾我。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:362
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_71a070d0:

    # mc "I didn't tell anyone you were coming, but you can probably talk to Sage, Maya, Josy, and maybe Jill."
    mc "我没告诉任何人你会来，不过你大概可以和Sage、Maya、Josy聊聊，也许还能和Jill说上话。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:363
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_380a07b5:

    # isa "Is Jill coming?"
    isa "Jill也会来吗？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:364
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_5bc10bff:

    # mc "It seems so. I spotted her on the invite list."
    mc "看起来是这样。我在邀请名单上看到了她。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:366
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_d816bf06:

    # isa "I doubt she wants to talk to me."
    isa "她恐怕不想和我说话。"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:368
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_b64911d3:

    # mc "She can't ignore you forever... It's gonna be good between you two again, right?"
    mc "她不可能永远不理你……你们最终会和好，对吧？"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:369
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_fb623a7e_5:

    # isa "..."
    isa "……"

# episode9\branches\ep9_isabella_branch.rpy:371
translate schinese ep9_bella_branch_label_fe13a8f8:

